            "props": {
              "markdown": {
                "escapeHtml": false
              },
              "source": "# Settings & Changeover\n\nStock `mes.recipe.sco*` (plus `mes.production.mesEquipmentManager`) screens for recipe-driven settings and changeover. Work through them in this order:\n\n1. **Equipment Manager** (Production module) - create the equipment and its recipe parameters.\n2. **Tree Editor** - create recipes against that equipment.\n3. **Recipe Selector** - activate a recipe.\n4. **Variance Viewer** - view variance, if enabled.\n5. **Changelog** - view the recipe changelog.\n6. **Analysis** - view analysis data.\n",
